Station)<\/strong>, percorrendo bairros lend\u00e1rios como Ginza, Asakusa (Templo Senso-ji), Akihabara e Nihonbashi.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">7 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u00e0s 09:10<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Tokyo Metropolitan Government Building (Shinjuku) \/ Tokyo Station, T\u00f3quio, Jap\u00e3o<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">42.195 km e 10.7 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Tokyo Marathon Foundation<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Tokyo Marathon<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 7 Mar \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:10<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">10.7km Race<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 7 Mar \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:10<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a Maratona de T\u00f3quio 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com a primeira vaga a partir \u00e0s 09h10 junto ao Tokyo Metropolitan Government Building em Shinjuku.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o processo de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para atletas internacionais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es gerais s\u00e3o sorteadas por lotaria oficial no m\u00eas de agosto do ano anterior, al\u00e9m de vagas garantidas por tempos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o de elite (Semi-Elite Overseas) e programas de caridade.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o percurso e onde fica a meta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso \u00e9 essencialmente plano e muito veloz, partindo de Shinjuku e passando por Iidabashi, Asakusa, Ginza e Shinagawa, com a meta instalada em Gyoko-dori frente \u00e0 Esta\u00e7\u00e3o de T\u00f3quio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova faz parte do circuito Six Star Finisher?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a Maratona de T\u00f3quio integra o restrito clube das seis World Marathon Majors (T\u00f3quio, Boston, Londres, Berlim, Chicago e Nova Iorque).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar informa\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todas as informa\u00e7\u00f5es e comunicados oficiais est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis no portal oficial da prova (www.marathon.tokyo).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de T\u00f3quio 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-07\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Tokyo Metropolitan Government Building (Shinjuku) \/ Tokyo Station, T\u00f3quio\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"T\u00f3quio\", \"addressRegion\": \"Jap\u00e3o\", \"addressCountry\": \"JP\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Tokyo Marathon Foundation\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\":